    "searchText": "foxwell enforcement careercontract orange level contract: potential security threat foxwellenforcement_patrol_stanton_hard foxwell enforcement careercontract standing mercenary pickup: unresolved for 6 variants several unknown ships have been spotted in areas frequented by haulers delivering goods for our client. they’re worried these ships are monitoring their haulers in preparation for an ambush, so they’ve hired us to patrol the area. \n\nstart by going to the location marker on your hud and scan it to ensure it’s clear. after that, we’ll send you to some other areas to scan for potential threats. we recommend that you bring a wingman and plenty of supplies to be ready to handle whatever might come your way.     \n\nalso know that successfully completing this contract will earn the main contractor a bonus payment of [scripamount] mg scrip.\n\ngood luck,\n\nkevin walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange level contract: security patrol red level contract: high-risk security patrol red level contract: secure threatened space yellow level contract: routine patrol yellow level contract: security sweep 82414003-38be-42d6-ba61-5d9d96e2f86a c017ad03-e29b-4aea-93f4-a4f9f3407abc cf2bff54-209a-427d-a137-bce73d6a7cae c4f5649b-5aba-412b-bca2-78b073d36b4d ae1596ff-c1ba-4b80-8265-b06e7864a3d5 501df9ce-0359-4492-80aa-cf5a746bbf9b blueprint: foxwell enforcement patrol: parallax \"sanguine\" energy assault rifle, antium arms sand, antium core sand, antium legs sand +2 standing +200 credits formula unresolved item reward: mg scrip completion tag standing +150 standing +250 standing +300"
